# 🎓 AI-Powered Smart Examination & Learning Analytics Platform
## Final Year Project Architecture & Implementation Plan

---

### 1. System Overview & Objectives
An enterprise-grade online testing and academic performance analytics platform tailored for educational institutions:
- **Teacher Role**: Create/manage classrooms, approve/reject student join requests, schedule MCQ tests with 4 options & time windows, view overall class performance graphs, and obtain deep **Gemini AI** insights on class growth and individual student trajectories.
- **Student Role**: Request access to teacher classes, receive notifications for scheduled tests, take timed MCQ tests with auto-grading, view instant scorecards, and track personal growth via AI-driven analytics.
- **Gemini AI Intelligence**: Evaluates student test patterns, identifies weak/strong areas, predicts learning trajectories, and generates automated actionable recommendations for teachers and students.

