### 4. Key Architectural Modules

#### A. Auth & Security Module
- User Registration & Login with Password Hashing (BCrypt).
- Google OAuth2 Integration & Seamless JWT token issuance.
- Role-based endpoints (`/api/teacher/**`, `/api/student/**`, `/api/common/**`).

#### B. Classroom & Request-Approval Workflow
- Teachers generate classes with unique alphanumeric `class_code`.
- Students submit join requests using `class_code`.
- Teacher gets instant notification and can review student requests: **Accept** or **Reject**.
- Only accepted students can view tests, notifications, and analytics for that class.

#### C. Test Creation & Scheduling Engine
- Teacher creates MCQ tests with 4 distinct options and defines the correct option.
- Configurable test window (start date/time, deadline, and countdown timer duration).
- Automatic student notification dispatch upon test publishing.

#### D. Interactive Test Taking & Auto-Evaluation Engine
- Secure student test interface with live countdown timer and anti-tamper safeguards.
- Auto-submission on timer expiry.
- Instant scoring and answer review.

#### E. Gemini AI Growth & Performance Analytics Engine
- **Individual Student Report**:
  - Compiles student historical scores, speed, accuracy, and topic weak-spots.
  - Prompts Gemini API to generate personalized learning diagnosis, trajectory predictions, and strengths/weaknesses.
- **Overall Class Growth Report**:
  - Aggregates score distributions, difficulty curves, top miss rates across questions.
  - Prompts Gemini API to generate pedagogical insights and class performance summaries.
- **Visualization Component**:
  - Interactive Chart.js graphs (Growth curves over time, Class bell curves, Skill radar charts).

#### F. In-App Notification System
- Real-time notification center for test announcements, enrollment approvals, and evaluation results.

